#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "100_Hana"
msgid "Chief..."
msgstr "Jefe..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "112_Akiyama"
msgid "He's made his decision. It's not my place to interfere."
msgstr "Ha tomado su decisión. No me corresponde interferir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "124_Hana"
msgid "But... becoming a loan shark, of all things."
msgstr "Pero... hacerse prestamista, entre tantas opciones..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "136_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, he probably has his reasons."
msgstr "Quién sabe. Debe tener sus motivos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "148_Hana"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "160_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm more concerned about our new customer. He should be here by now."
msgstr "Ahora mismo estoy más preocupado por el nuevo cliente. Ya debería haber llegado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "172_Hana"
msgid "You're right. He said he was nearby."
msgstr "Tiene razón. Dijo que estaba cerca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "220_Hana"
msgid "Hello, this is Sky Finance."
msgstr "Hola, Sky Finance al habla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "232_Potential Client"
msgid "Hi, yes, I called a little while ago..."
msgstr "Hola, sí, llamé hace un rato..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "244_Potential Client"
msgid "A young man outside your building offered to talk with me\\r\nand took me over to a different office."
msgstr "Un joven afuera de su edificio se acercó a hablarme\\r\ny me llevó a una oficina diferente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "256_Hana"
msgid "One moment, please."
msgstr "Un momento, por favor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "268_Hana"
msgid "Chief? It's the customer who called earlier. It sounds like\\r\nShiobara-san got to him..."
msgstr "Jefe, es el cliente que llamó antes.\\r\nParece que Shiobara-san se lo llevó..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "316_Akiyama"
msgid "Hello, Akiyama speaking. You were saying something about a\\r\nyoung man outside my office?"
msgstr "Buenas, aquí el jefe. Cómo es eso de que lo llevaron a otra\\r\noficina."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "328_Potential Client"
msgid "Oh, uh, that's right. I humored the young man with what he\\r\nhad to say, but I still wanted to stop by your place."
msgstr "Ah, así es. Es que le seguí la corriente a ese joven,\\r\npero aún quiero pasarme por tu oficina."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "340_Potential Client"
msgid "So now I'm calling you from his office restroom..."
msgstr "Ahora mismo te estoy llamando desde el baño del lugar..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "352_Akiyama"
msgid "Any chance you can just turn him down and leave?"
msgstr "¿No puedes simplemente decirle que no e irte?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "364_Potential Client"
msgid "Well... I feel like he's going to pressure me into signing\\r\nsomething."
msgstr "Es que, siento que me va a obligar a firmar un contrato\\r\no algo así."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "376_Akiyama"
msgid "All right. Wait right there. Where is this office?"
msgstr "Entiendo. Espera allí. ¿Dónde está la oficina?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "388_Potential Client"
msgid "Um, I think it's right near the M Store. It's a white\\r\nbuilding."
msgstr "Veamos, creo que está cerca de la M Store.\\r\nEs un edificio blanco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "400_Akiyama"
msgid "Near the M Store? Okay, hang tight－and don't sign anything."
msgstr "¿Cerca de la M Store? Por favor, espérame en el lugar y no firmes nada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "436_Akiyama"
msgid "Okay, I'll be back."
msgstr "Es hora de irme."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "472_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey there."
msgstr "Buenas, buenas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "496_Hana"
msgid "Hello, Chief. You're back late."
msgstr "Bienvenido de nuevo, jefe. Llega tarde."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "508_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah, well..."
msgstr "Un poquito..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "520_Hana"
msgid "Hmm, what have you been up to...? Anyway, did you hear the rumors?"
msgstr "Muy sospechoso... Cambiando de tema, ¿escuchó los rumores?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "532_Akiyama"
msgid "Rumors?"
msgstr "¿Rumores?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "544_Hana"
msgid "About Shiobara-san. The man you lent five million yen to?"
msgstr "Acerca de Shiobara-san.\nEl hombre al que le prestó cinco millones de yenes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "556_Akiyama"
msgid "What about him?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa con él?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "568_Hana"
msgid "Apparently, Shiobara-san is really coming up in the world\\r\nthese days."
msgstr "Aparentemente a Shiobara-san le está yendo muy bien\\r\núltimamente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "580_Akiyama"
msgid "Is this the same Shiobara?"
msgstr "¿Hablamos del mismo Shiobara?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "592_Shiobara"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr "¡Hola!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "604_Akiyama"
msgid "Speak of the devil."
msgstr "Hablando del rey de roma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "616_Shiobara"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "628_Akiyama"
msgid "Never mind. Please, have a seat."
msgstr "Olvida eso. Por favor, toma asiento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "640_Shiobara"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "700_Akiyama"
msgid "So, did you figure out what you want to do?"
msgstr "¿Y terminaste encontrando lo que querías hacer?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "712_Shiobara"
msgid "I did. I'm going to work in finance, just like you."
msgstr "Así es. También trabajaré en el mundo de las finanzas, igual que usted."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "724_Akiyama"
msgid "You want to do finance?"
msgstr "¿Vas a dedicarte a las finanzas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "736_Shiobara"
msgid "You've been a big influence, of course."
msgstr "Sí, usted ha sido una gran influencia para mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "748_Shiobara"
msgid "But, more than that, I'd once faced money troubles of my\\r\nown."
msgstr "Además, también enfrenté problemas económicos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "760_Shiobara"
msgid "I decided I wanted to do something involving money－as a way\\r\nof overcoming my own problems, too."
msgstr "Por eso me gustaría hacer algo que involucre dinero.\\r\nCómo forma de superar mis propios problemas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "772_Akiyama"
msgid "You don't say..."
msgstr "No me digas..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "784_Shiobara"
msgid "So I started out like you did, Akiyama-san, and did some\\r\nday-trading."
msgstr "Así que empecé igualito a usted, Akiyama-san,\\r\ncon algo de day trading."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "796_Akiyama"
msgid "You were a day-trader?"
msgstr "¿Hiciste day trading?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "808_Shiobara"
msgid "Uh-huh. You need money to work in finance, so I made the\\r\nmost of your advice."
msgstr "Ajá. Se necesita dinero para trabajar en finanzas,\\r\nasí que seguí sus consejos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "820_Akiyama"
msgid "I don't think I really told you anything all that useful,\\r\nbut okay."
msgstr "No creo haber dicho algo suficientemente útil\\r\ncomo para ser considerado un consejo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "832_Shiobara"
msgid "Well, I did plenty of studying on my own, too. To tell you\\r\nthe truth, I've never pushed myself so hard in all my life."
msgstr "Bueno, también estudié muchísimo por mi cuenta.\\r\nLa verdad, nunca me había esforzado tanto en mí vida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "844_Shiobara"
msgid "Maybe the effort paid off, or maybe I was just good at it,\\r\nbut that five million yen grew and grew. I've amassed a\\r\nsizable sum, if I do say so myself."
msgstr "No sé si los esfuerzos dieron resultados o si tenía talento\\r\npara ello, pero los cinco millones siguieron creciendo\\r\ny creciendo. Y ahora tengo una suma considerable."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "856_Shiobara"
msgid "Granted, it's not as much as you have!"
msgstr "¡Pero de seguro no es nada comparado a lo que tiene Akiyama-san!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "868_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "880_Shiobara"
msgid "I thought I'd come by today and return the money you lent\\r\nme..."
msgstr "Y es por eso que hoy, he venido a devolverte el dinero\\r\nque me prestaste..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "892_Shiobara"
msgid "To that end, I've prepared ten million yen."
msgstr "Y para ello he preparado diez millones de yenes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "904_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm sure we agreed I wouldn't charge you any interest."
msgstr "Estoy seguro de que acordamos un préstamo sin intereses."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "916_Shiobara"
msgid "No, I just want to express my gratitude."
msgstr "No es eso, es que quiero expresar mi gratitud."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "928_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, I'm only taking five million."
msgstr "De todas formas, sólo tomaré cinco millones."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "940_Shiobara"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr "...Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "988_Shiobara"
msgid "Consider this as thanks for all your help."
msgstr "Considera esto un agradecimiento por toda su ayuda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1000_Hana"
msgid "But I didn't do anything. I really can't accept this."
msgstr "Pero yo no hice nada. No puedo aceptarlo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1012_Shiobara"
msgid "Oh, go on. Take it."
msgstr "Oh, vamos. Tómalo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1072_Akiyama"
msgid "...You've really changed."
msgstr "...Realmente has cambiado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1084_Shiobara"
msgid "I took the money you lent me and fought like hell to make\\r\nit grow, all in the hopes of truly changing my life for the\\r\nbetter."
msgstr "Tomé el dinero que me prestó y me esforcé como loco\\r\npara hacerlo crecer, todo con la esperanza de cambiar\\r\nmi vida para mejor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1096_Shiobara"
msgid "I believed in what you told me－that if I proved I was\\r\nserious, people would be happy to work with me."
msgstr "Creí en lo que me dijiste: si demostraba que iba en serio,\\r\nla gente estaría encantada de trabajar conmigo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1108_Shiobara"
msgid "It was the first time I'd really applied myself like that."
msgstr "Es la primera vez que doy todo de mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1120_Shiobara"
msgid "And before I knew it, everything was different－the world\\r\naround me and everyone in it."
msgstr "Y antes de darme cuenta, todo había cambiado.\\r\nEl entorno y las personas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1132_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1144_Shiobara"
msgid "At first I thought, \"Wow, Akiyama-san was right after all.\""
msgstr "Al principio pensé: \"Wow, Akiyama-san tenía razón después de todo\"."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1156_Shiobara"
msgid "But then I gradually came to understand that the reason\\r\nthose around me were so accommodating wasn't that I was\\r\nmaking such an earnest effort."
msgstr "Pero poco a poco empecé a entender de que las personas\\r\nque me rodeaban no estaban actuando así porque\\r\nfuese serio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1168_Shiobara"
msgid "It was because I was successful and had money."
msgstr "Era porque tenia éxito y dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1180_Shiobara"
msgid "That's when I realized something: in order to change\\r\nsomebody's life, you need money."
msgstr "Fue entonces cuando me di cuenta de algo:\\r\nPara cambiar la vida de alguien, solo se necesita dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1192_Shiobara"
msgid "That's why you can spur people into action, Akiyama-san.\\r\nYou have money."
msgstr "La razón por la que Akiyama-san puede motivar a las personas,\\r\nes porque tiene dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1204_Shiobara"
msgid "After all, it was your money that changed me."
msgstr "Después de todo, yo también pude cambiar gracias a tu dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1216_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1228_Hana"
msgid "Akiyama-san..."
msgstr "Akiyama-san..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1276_Hana"
msgid "Hello, this is Sky Finance."
msgstr "Hola, Sky Finance al habla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1288_Potential Client"
msgid "Er, I was on my way over to your office, and I know I'm in\\r\nthe right neighborhood..."
msgstr "Em, estaba de camino a su oficina, sé que ando bastante\\r\ncerca..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1300_Potential Client"
msgid "...but I'm having a hard time finding it."
msgstr "...pero sigo sin encontrarla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1312_Hana"
msgid "Where are you now?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está ahora?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1324_Potential Client"
msgid "I'm under the Kamurocho gate. I can see a big sign for\\r\nManzoku Sushi."
msgstr "Estoy bajo la puerta de Kamurocho. Puedo ver el cartel de\\r\nSushi Manzoku."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1336_Hana"
msgid "Okay. Walk toward the sign, then go about 100 meters toward\\r\nthe theater."
msgstr "Bueno, siga hacia el cartel, luego avance unos cien metros\\r\nen dirección al teatro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1348_Hana"
msgid "The New Serena building will be on your left. We're on the\\r\nfifth floor."
msgstr "A su izquierda verá el edificio New Serena. La oficina se\\r\nencuentra en el quinto piso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1360_Potential Client"
msgid "Got it. Thank you very much. I'll be right over."
msgstr "Lo tengo. Muchas gracias. Estaré por allá en un rato."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1396_Shiobara"
msgid "A new customer?"
msgstr "¿Un nuevo cliente?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1408_Hana"
msgid "Sounds like it."
msgstr "Así parece."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1420_Shiobara"
msgid "As it just so happens, I've decided to be a moneylender here in Kamurocho myself."
msgstr "De hecho, también he decidido hacerme prestamista aquí en Kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1432_Akiyama"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "¿Qué...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1444_Hana"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1468_Shiobara"
msgid "I guess that means we'll be rivals. But what's business\\r\nwithout a little friendly competition? Well, I'd better be off."
msgstr "De ahora en adelante trabajaremos en el mismo sector.\\r\nEstoy ansioso de trabajar codo a codo. Ahora, si me disculpa."

